{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXTRA EXTRA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Newsie is done spreading the news\u2014he wants to<i> make</i>\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Page Turner</strong> is a classic run-and-gun platformer complete with secrets to discover, weapon pickups to collect, and boss fights to take down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 1920's BigCity as a Newsie chasing leads in pursuit of becoming an investigative journalist. Each level is inspired by a major historical event from the 1920s including the Black Sox Scandal, Prohibition, and the obscene working conditions that inspired Upton Sinclair's <i>The Jungle.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Support Your Leads with Photographic Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and photograph <strong>Secret Photos</strong> to support your story and rack up bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/Secretphoto.gif?t=1744485297\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade Your Attacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect unique pickups, from the homing Paper Airplane <strong>Flyers</strong> to the shaken <strong>Soda Thrower</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/pickups_compressed.gif?t=1744485297\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ink-Slingin' Shutterbug</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take out multiple foes at once by hucking jars of <strong>Ink</strong> or stun groups with your <strong>Camera Flash.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/inkflash_compressed.gif?t=1744485297\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stand up to the Big Cheeses of BigCity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skill against challenging boss fights at the end of every third stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/boss.gif?t=1744485297\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BigCity Deserves Better</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't let anyone stand in your way of getting the truth in print. The people deserve to know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/Signingoff.gif?t=1744485297\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600210?t=1744485297","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/b634b0306e0fb3d178fac217e50be89867d31c8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744485297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/8a1f61d9703e4a7852b2edd9f8c19b9cdd9bb4c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744485297","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/8a1f61d9703e4a7852b2edd9f8c19b9cdd9bb4c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744485297","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3600320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXTRA EXTRA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Newsie is done spreading the news\u2014he wants to<i> make</i>\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Page Turner</strong> is a classic run-and-gun platformer complete with secrets to discover, weapon pickups to collect, and boss fights to take down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 1920's BigCity as a Newsie chasing leads in pursuit of becoming an investigative jour